RLT points      points/co2-and-o2.yaml
context         co2-and-o2 — "One CO₂ molecule and one O₂ molecule, and their five atoms, counted with 1 + 2 = 3, 1 + 1 = 2 and 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 5."
  basis         "Keep the mathematical counts distinct from the records assigning atom identifiers to molecules."  [RLT-002-T7-APPROVAL]
references      math5 (its documented meanings stay in readingpoints/math5.yaml)
  record valid (context: basis and references)
